     <section anchor="abstract" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-1">
       <name slugifiedName="name-abstract">Abstract</name>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-1-1">This document examines the problems associated with use of MIME
-security multiparts and gateways to non-MIME environments. A set of
-requirements for gateway behavior are defined which provide
-facilities necessary to properly accomodate the transfer of security
-multiparts through gateways.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-1-1">This document examines the problems associated with use of MIME security multiparts and gateways to non-MIME environments. A set of requirements for gateway behavior are defined which provide facilities necessary to properly accomodate the transfer of security multiparts through gateways.</t>
     </section>
     <section anchor="requirements-notation" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-2">
       <name slugifiedName="name-requirements-notation">Requirements Notation</name>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-1">This document occasionally uses terms that appear in capital letters.
-When the terms &quot;<bcp14>MUST</bcp14>&quot;, &quot;<bcp14>MUST NOT</bcp14>&quot;, &quot;<bcp14>SHOULD</bcp14>&quot;, &quot;<bcp14>SHOULD NOT</bcp14>&quot;, and &quot;<bcp14>MAY</bcp14>&quot;
